        <mxCell id="20" value="OFFICIAL RFC 2104 FORMULA:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;HMAC(K, M) = SHA256( (K₀ ⊕ opad)  ‖  SHA256( (K₀ ⊕ ipad) ‖ M ) )&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Why Hash TWICE?&lt;br&gt;Stops &quot;length-extension&quot; attacks where a hacker adds extra&lt;br&gt;data onto a single plain hash without knowing the key!" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F4F5F7;strokeColor=#D0D5DD;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#1E2226;fontSize=13;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
